  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IN ORDER TO FACILITATE TRADE OPERATIONS,THIS TC OBJECTIVES ARE TO REVIEW AND SIMPLIFY NORMS AND PROCEDURES IN THE CUSTOMS AREA, TO DEVELOP COMPUTERIZED PROGRAMS, TO CREATE A STANDARD COMPUTERIZED SYSTEM, TO DEVELOP A HUMAN RESOURCES POLICY, TO ACCESS TO PROPER EQUIPMENT AND TO STRENGTHEN THE TRAINING INSTITUTE.</narrative>
